  "summary_insights": [
    "Total revenue shows a strong upward trajectory, growing from £15.4m in 2023 to a projected £28.2m by 2030, driven by the core Alideck brand and expansion into Milwood and Lurano.",
    "Gross margin has improved significantly from 27.5% in 2023 to a steady 38-39% range from 2027 onwards, indicating better cost control or pricing power.",
    "Operating profit (EBITDA) shows consistent growth, nearly doubling between 2025 (£2.8m) and 2030 (£5.3m) as the business achieves greater scale.",
    "The Milwood and Lurano product lines, while smaller than Alideck, show high growth rates, with Milwood reaching £4m and Lurano over £0.5m by 2030.",
    "Overheads are being managed effectively, growing at a much slower rate than revenue, which is driving significant operational leverage and margin expansion.",
    "The 2024 dip in revenue (-8.96% for Alideck) was successfully reversed, with double-digit growth returning in subsequent years.",
    "Profitability for the Milwood segment turned positive in 2027 after initial losses, contributing to the overall group's financial resilience.",
    "The group demonstrates a healthy financial profile with increasing cash flow potential as EBITDA margins trend towards 19-20% in the later forecast years."
